Task: In-Browser QR Scanner & Receiving Interface (TDD)

Summary of Changes:
- Implemented delivery status transition validation, item quantity inspection evaluation, checklist validation, and QR token lookup service in src/lib/receiving.ts.
- Built mobile-first SPPG receiving screen (src/components/sppg-receiving-workspace.tsx) with camera QR scanner (html5-qrcode), manual QR token fallback, incoming delivery queue selector, and interactive item inspection checklist.
- Added Next.js Server Actions and /sppg page route in src/app/sppg/actions.ts and src/app/sppg/page.tsx.
- Added unit and UI component tests in src/test/receiving.test.ts and src/test/receiving-ui.test.tsx.

Why:
Enables SPPG central kitchen operators to scan or enter a cooperative delivery QR token and inspect delivered food commodities against the Surat Jalan Digital.
